## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **`Object.create(null)`** as accumulator | Avoids collisions between group keys and built-in prototype properties (`constructor`, `toString`, `__proto__`, …) |
| **`hasOwnProperty` via `Object.prototype.call`** | Safe even on null-prototype objects where `.hasOwnProperty` doesn't exist directly |
| **No mutation** of input | `push` only touches the accumulator, never the source array |
| **Single-pass `reduce`** | O(n) time, one iteration, minimal overhead |
| **Strict guard clauses** | Fail loudly and early with descriptive messages instead of silent wrong results |
| **Generic `T` / `K` types** | Works with any item type and any primitive key type |

