### Key design decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Lazy eviction** | Expired entries are removed on access rather than via a background timer, keeping the implementation simple and dependency-free. |
| **Per-entry TTL override** | Allows fine-grained control without needing a separate cache instance. |
| **`set` returns `this`** | Enables method chaining: `cache.set('a', 1).set('b', 2)`. |
| **`expiresAt: null`** | A sentinel value that clearly distinguishes "never expires" from any numeric timestamp. |
| **Private `_isAlive`** | Centralises expiry logic so `get`, `has`, and `delete` all behave consistently. |

