## Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| **Private `#store`** | Prevents external mutation of internal state |
| **`null` vs `0` for no expiry** | Avoids ambiguity — `null` clearly means "never expires" |
| **`has` delegates to `get`** | Single source of truth for expiry logic |
| **`set` returns `this`** | Enables ergonomic method chaining |
| **Input validation in `set`** | Fails fast with a clear error rather than silently misbehaving |

