### Key design decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Private `#store`** | Prevents external mutation of the underlying `Map`. |
| **`null` expiresAt** | Cleanly distinguishes "no TTL" from a numeric timestamp without a magic value. |
| **Lazy expiry** | Expired entries are evicted on access (`get` / `has`) rather than with a background timer, keeping the class dependency-free. |
| **`set` returns `this`** | Enables fluent chaining (`cache.set('a',1).set('b',2)`). |
| **`delete` returns `boolean`** | Mirrors the native `Map.delete` contract so callers can tell whether anything was actually removed. |

