## Behavior at a Glance

| Scenario | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `200 OK` | Returns `Response` immediately |
| `404 Not Found` | Returns `Response` immediately (not retried by default) |
| `503 Service Unavailable` | Retried up to `retries` times |
| `429 Too Many Requests` | Retried with exponential backoff |
| Network error (offline) | Retried up to `retries` times |
| All retries exhausted | Throws last `Error` (with `.response` if HTTP error) |

