## Delay Schedule (defaults: `baseDelay=300`, `maxDelay=10000`, `jitter=true`)

```
Attempt 1 → ~300ms  (300 * 2^0)
Attempt 2 → ~600ms  (300 * 2^1)
Attempt 3 → ~1200ms (300 * 2^2)
Attempt 4 → ~2400ms (300 * 2^3)
Attempt 5 → ~4800ms (300 * 2^4)
...capped at 10,000ms
```

