## Retry Delay Schedule

With `baseDelay: 300ms`, `maxDelay: 10000ms`, jitter disabled:

| Attempt | Formula         | Delay   |
|---------|-----------------|---------|
| 1st retry | 300 × 2⁰    | 300 ms  |
| 2nd retry | 300 × 2¹    | 600 ms  |
| 3rd retry | 300 × 2²    | 1200 ms |
| 4th retry | 300 × 2³    | 2400 ms |
| 5th retry | 300 × 2⁴    | 4800 ms |
| 6th retry | 300 × 2⁵    | 9600 ms |
| 7th retry | 300 × 2⁶    | capped at 10000 ms |

> With **jitter enabled** (default), each delay is randomly adjusted by ±20% to spread out concurrent retries and avoid thundering herd problems.

