───────  ────────────────────────────  ──────────────────────────────────────
  1      min(300 * 2^0, 10000) + j  =  ~300ms  + jitter
  2      min(300 * 2^1, 10000) + j  =  ~600ms  + jitter
  3      min(300 * 2^2, 10000) + j  =  ~1200ms + jitter
  4      min(300 * 2^3, 10000) + j  =  ~2400ms + jitter
  5      min(300 * 2^4, 10000) + j  =  ~4800ms + jitter
  6      min(300 * 2^5, 10000) + j  =  ~9600ms + jitter
  7+     min(300 * 2^n, 10000) + j  =  ~10000ms (capped) + jitter
