## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Jitter** | Random noise prevents multiple clients from retrying in sync (thundering herd) |
| **AbortSignal passthrough** | Respects cancellation during both fetch and delay phases |
| **`retryOn` whitelist** | 4xx errors (except 429) are client bugs — retrying won't help |
| **`onRetry` callback** | Keeps core logic decoupled from logging/metrics concerns |
| **Error message enrichment** | Preserves original error while adding actionable context |

